  "body": "> This is a security release to address vulnerabilities in the handling of archive files (zip, tar, rpm, whl, gem, etc).  A maliciously crafted archive file counted with cloc versions before this release can allow a remote code execution (RCE) attack.\r\n\r\n> All users are encouraged to update to this (or newer, when available) version.\r\n\r\n## New Languages and File Types:\r\n- AL (Business Central)\r\n- CUE\r\n- KDL\r\n- RON\r\n- Salam\r\n- Sema\r\n- Windows INF\r\n- Wren\r\n\r\n## Updates:\r\n- Add ability to count contents of .gem files.\r\n- New switch `--total` to show total column counts\r\n- Make `--exclude-lang` case insensitive to make it consistent with `--include-lang`\r\n- Recognize comment markers in single quoted QML strings\r\n- Add .scp as an extension for SQL stored procedures\r\n- Add `.inc` as an extension for Assembly\r\n\r\nBug fixes:\r\n- Secure handling of system calls to expand archive files.\r\n- Prevent regex timeouts in Swift.\r\n- Lower memory requirements when handling large XML/HTML and binary files.\r\n- Fix double-open on Windows when handling long paths.\r\n- Ensure an archive file is not a directory before attempting to extract it."
